                                "sense_id": "65b3cf2c-33a9-38c0-aa3e-6ea08c4082b9",
                                "text": "My participance was prurient rather than licentious and scarcely one pleasant memory of it remains from those days; as Ernest Hemingway once remarked, the sole purpose of the cabaret is for unattached men to find complaisant women."
