                                "sense_id": "65b3cf2c-33a9-38c0-aa3e-6ea08c4082b9",
                                "text": "However, a possible participance of aerobic processes may be supposed on the basis of cytochrome studies. This problem was thoroughly studied by Cheah (1975), who used the cytochromes from Ascaris suum muscle mitochondria."
