                                "example_id": "ab2a5017-7be3-4e94-816f-1dda49809661",
                                "sense_id": "65b3cf2c-33a9-38c0-aa3e-6ea08c4082b9",
                                "text": "Examples (37) and (38) show that it is not only most convenient to link instruments and beneficients^([sic]) to events by using participance relations, but that moreover no further grammatical \"licensing\" processes operate which would rule out anaphoric sentences like the ones above."
